---

This project is a derivative work based on:
  https://github.com/allentnetus/dsh-job-hunting  (MIT License)

It reuses that project's Workspace conventions, data-file layout
(data/jobs.json, profile/, the output directory tree), atomic-write pattern,
FNV-1a hashing, and its read-only BrowserSkill collection safety design
(exact-hostname allowlist, no write-style browser actions, explicit user
approval). No compiled artifacts from the upstream project are redistributed.
